Input: {"question": "20000 series is operated by which private railway operator?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0076-7101385d705c:d00", "start": 0, "end": 237, "text": "Odakyu 20000 series RSE The (Resort Super Express) is an electric multiple unit (EMU) train type operated between 1991 and March 2012 by the private railway operator Odakyu Electric Railway on \"Asagiri\" limited express services in Japan."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0076-7101385d705c:d00", "start": 238, "end": 386, "text": "Up until 16 March 2012, the 20000 series RSE operated mainly between Odakyu's terminus in Tokyo and JR Central's Numazu Station on the Gotemba Line."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0076-7101385d705c:d00", "start": 387, "end": 472, "text": "On weekends, some trains operated between Shinjuku Station and Hakone-Yumoto Station."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0076-7101385d705c:d00", "start": 473, "end": 556, "text": "The two 7-car sets are formed as follows, with car 1 at the Odawara and Numazu end."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0076-7101385d705c:d00", "start": 557, "end": 599, "text": "Cars 1, 2, 6, and 7 each have one scissors"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0076-7101385d705c:d01", "start": 0, "end": 3, "text": "1 ."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0076-7101385d705c:d01", "start": 4, "end": 29, "text": "Retrieved 12 April 2022 ."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0076-7101385d705c:d01", "start": 30, "end": 160, "text": "^ a b c 通勤車両１０００形のリニューアルに着手！ [ Start of refurbishment of 1000 series commuter trains ] ( PDF ) ( Press release ) ( in Japanese ) ."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0076-7101385d705c:d01", "start": 161, "end": 194, "text": "Japan : Odakyu Electric Railway ."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0076-7101385d705c:d01", "start": 195, "end": 210, "t